      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "· fast continuation & elaborate live state dominate\n· pause/resume is frequent and should stay cheap\n· rebuilding everything from events is awkward",
      "originalText": "· fast continuation & elaborate live state dominate\n· pause/resume is frequent and should stay cheap\n· rebuilding everything from events is awkward",
